This project provides additional Chinese translations, source patches,
build/check scripts and documentation. Modifications include translated UI
and native menus, isolated local data identifiers, the desktop self-package
lockfile version correction, frontend embedding configuration, and a window
background initialization timing fix. See the complete patches and docs.

